OrangeIslands_Valencia_Beach_House_Text_Diver::
	.string "I swim the reef every morning.\p"
	.string "There are places out there where\n"
	.string "the bottom just drops away, and\l"
	.string "the water goes dark.\p"
	.string "You can't swim down. Not without\n"
	.string "a POKEMON that knows how.$"
